        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a new twist to the classic Spider Solitaire in <strong>Pokitaire</strong>! Turning this classic puzzle game into a score chasing arcade puzzle game with this solitaire and poker hybrid. Clear cards by playing poker hands instead of simply sorting them and chase highscores instead of only clearing cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503870/extras/463a8e586209b9ca41ecef375942ec15.poster.avif?t=1761109245\" width=616 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503870/extras/463a8e586209b9ca41ecef375942ec15.webm?t=1761109245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503870/extras/463a8e586209b9ca41ecef375942ec15.mp4?t=1761109245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how this twist gets thoroughly explored with more than a dozen decks, all with their own twist and rules. Some twists are minor, some major, but all will require you to approach each deck with a different eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503870/extras/bbf623c2edbb41c12cd329fd1db0f237.poster.avif?t=1761109245\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503870/extras/bbf623c2edbb41c12cd329fd1db0f237.webm?t=1761109245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503870/extras/bbf623c2edbb41c12cd329fd1db0f237.mp4?t=1761109245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play impressive poker hands by going beyond the poker night table and discover the many definitely illegal poker hands. Discover them to give you an edge or discover them for your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503870/extras/390e6ac4e2afff4aa79105ec2ccf4566.poster.avif?t=1761109245\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503870/extras/390e6ac4e2afff4aa79105ec2ccf4566.webm?t=1761109245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503870/extras/390e6ac4e2afff4aa79105ec2ccf4566.mp4?t=1761109245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503870/extras/12d95463330c481339ad0467875201e9.poster.avif?t=1761109245\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503870/extras/12d95463330c481339ad0467875201e9.webm?t=1761109245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503870/extras/12d95463330c481339ad0467875201e9.mp4?t=1761109245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
